✗ --title and --reason are both required.

commandments feature-request — File a [feature-request] GitHub issue (via `gh`) proposing a new or changed rule.

Usage:
  commandments feature-request --title="…" --reason="…"
                                    propose it

Options:
  --title="…"   a short title for the proposal (required)
  --reason="…"  what to add or change, and why (required)

